url: "https://caseattend.com"
abstract: >-
  CaseAttend is an open-source, bring-your-own-key web application that teaches
  radiology and pathology by working through real medical images with a
  question-first AI tutor. It was selected as one of 50 winners out of 4,096
  entries in the "Vibe Code with Gemini 3 Pro" Kaggle hackathon.
